  "title": "Walmart and Avery Dennison collaborate to enhance freshness and increase operational efficiency using RFID | Avery Dennison",
  "summary": "Looking to help develop a solution to a longstanding industry challenge of using RFID technology in high-moisture, cold environments, like meat cases, Walmart teamed with Avery Dennison to create and test a first-of-its-kind sensor technology that brings RFID-enabled labels to the meat department.",
